        <mxCell id="nVFVpwAe7lqRvnvSEs3c-3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;**Description:**&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;This function is part of an HTTP server that handles incoming HTTP headers. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;The goal is to verify if the incoming header is fully received and process &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;the valid portion of it. Any remaining unused data should be retained for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;subsequent processing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;**Context:**&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;- acceptable_http_headers: list[bytes], a set of permissible HTTP header &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;versions like [&quot;HTTP/1.1&quot;] to ensure compatibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;**Function Name:** `process_http_request`&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;**Arguments:**&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;- request_data: bytes, the raw incoming network data that contains or partially &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;contains an HTTP header.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;**Returns:**&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;bytes, the remaining part of the buffer after processing the valid HTTP header.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;**Raises:**&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;- ValueError: if the HTTP header is incomplete or invalid, or if processing fails.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;**Setup**:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;The following setup code has already been provided. You should use this in the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;beginning of your code.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;acceptable_http_headers = [b&quot;HTTP/1.1&quot;]&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;Important: Write your reasoning steps within &amp;lt;think&amp;gt; and &amp;lt;/think&amp;gt; tags. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;And wrap your final code implementation within &amp;lt;code&amp;gt; and &amp;lt;/code&amp;gt; tags.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;Example format:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;think&amp;gt;Your reasoning steps here...&amp;lt;/think&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;Your final code implementation here...&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre; color: rgb(204, 204, 204);&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;/code&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
